window.products.push({"id":228167,"name":"TERRA THREAD Home 100% Organic Cotton Queen Dark Blue Sheet Set, Sateen Weave, 4 Piece,GOTS Certified,Soft Silky Shiny, Luxury Finish,Fits Upto 17\" De","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81oNPGxr2OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ Bring Home your modern-day Organic Heirloom: TERRA THREAD HOME bed sheets are exquisitely & ethically crafted for a sustainable lifestyle. Queen Size, All Dark Blue, 4-Piece Sheet Set. This sheet set includes: 1 Flat Sheet (96\" X 109\"), 1 Fitted Sheet (60”x 80\"x17”) and 2 Pillowcase (21”x32”). Packaged using recyclable & sustainable materials, it comes with a 100% organic cotton reusable bag to compliment your green lifestyle. ✅ 100% Organic Cotton GOTS certified: Made from long staple Organic Cotton, these are by far the softest, most durable & luxurious bed sheets. Easy to take care it grows even softer with each wash. Buttery soft 300 thread count Sateen weave fabric is supple and has a slight sheen. Generously sized to compensate for any shrinkage in washing. Sheet Set have deep pockets to fit mattresses of all sizes. ✅ LET US MAKE IT SUSTAINABLE: The Organic Cotton is grown in rain-fed farms in India, which uses less water & energy. Organic production further reduces carbon emissions, improves soil fertility and increases biodiversity. No Genetically Modified Seeds, harmful chemicals, or dyes go into our products Only natural fertilizers, & low impact dyes are used to ensure that no harm is done to our planet, farmers, workers & you. ✅ People & planet friendly: Our sheets are Fairtrade Certified which means that you can sleep well knowing farmers are paid a good price. Fair Trade also means a traceable supply chain, higher wages, better labor practices, respectful relationships, community development & respect for local culture. Terra Thread is also B Corp Certified which is businesses that balance purpose and profit, being legally accountable for their decisions that impact its customers, suppliers and the environment. ✅ Creating Goodness that returns Goodness: When you put something good out into the world, something good comes back to you. For every product sold we contribute free meals in the U.S. to the ones in need through the Feeding America program. This contribution is matched by the Tony Robbins One Billion Meals Challenge, doubling the impact. A product for every occasion – This sheet set is the best sustainable & ethical gifting choice for birthdays, weddings, anniversaries.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81oNPGxr2OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TERRA THREAD","source_asin":"B0B2M2G14G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-228167","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2M2G14G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2M2G14G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
