window.products.push({"id":228183,"name":"WDNM Portable Air Conditioner Exhaust Hose Coupler,AC AC Air Conditioner Exhaust Hose Coupler 56 Inch AC Window Vent Kit,Universal Clockwise Countercl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.39,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518C+qsEHRS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Specifications: To enable connections to exhaust hose and window kit plate.To enables connections to exhaust hose and window kit plate leaves out warm air, insects, mosquitoes out of your space. Due to it can efficient return flow of warm air enter your space so that your air conditioning unit can be more efficient and cools your room in less time. The window seal helps you save on electrical consumption efficient reduce energy consumption which contribute to the global environmental protection.Durable and moneysaving, can be used for a long time. Easy to install and remove.Connected to the exhaust hose, and can be easily installed on the back of the portable air conditioner.No need for drilling holes it's sipmly and easy. Used to connect air conditioning exhaust pipes, portable, durable and easy to install. Used to connect and extend the exhaust hose. Suitable for diameter of 13cm/15cm exhaust hose. Item Name: Exhaust Hose Connector Material: ABS Features: Portable, Durable, Flexible, Easy to Use Size Detail: Type 13cm: 10.2cm x 13.7cm/4.02 x 5.39 (Approx.) Type 15cm: 10.2cm x 15.7cm/4.02 x 6.18 (Approx.)Notes: Please be sure to measure the diameter you need before purchasing (Based on the outside diameter). Due to the light and screen setting difference, the item's color may be slightly different from the pictures. Please allow slight dimension difference due to different manual measurement.;Package Includes: 1 x Exhaust Hose Connector","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518C+qsEHRS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WDNM","source_asin":"B096KQNT2S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-228183","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096KQNT2S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096KQNT2S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":228184,"name":"Truweigh TUFFWEIGH Digital Mini Scale (200g x 0.01g) - Rubberized Impact Resistant Digital Kitchen Scale - Travel Digital Pocket Scale - Digital Food ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51o-sTgnImL._SL1000_.jpg","description":"Truweigh is a leader in the kitchen food scale industry, with a wide range in scales for every market, we have a pocket scale to fit every need. The TUFFWEIGH 200g x 0.01g is known for its durability, with a double mold secured around the scale it can take on any fall or drop. The toughness of this scale makes it ideal for a work bench or construction site. All Truweigh food weight scales come with a 10 year limited warranty protecting your purchase. The TUFFWEIGH digital mini scale features a rubberized, impact-resistant exterior for maximum durability with a shape that easily fits in your pocket or bag. The hinged cover can detach to be used as a weighing tray, giving you ample room to weigh your products. Our scale features a built-in overload protection that helps prevent damage to the scale. Our durable scale also includes a programmable auto off (0, 60, 120 or 180 seconds of inactivity with 0 having the auto-off feature disabled. Our Truweigh TUFFWEIGH scale ships to you pre-calibrated but we suggest purchasing one of our 200g calibration weights to keep your measurements accurate over time. The TUFFWEIGH scale for grams comes in 4 different colors: All Black, Red/Black, Green/Black, and Orange/Black. The Truweigh TUFFWEIGH herb weighing scale has a max capacity of 200g and a readability of 0.01g making this the best scale for herb. It also comes with an in-depth instruction manual to make sure you utilize all features that come with our Truweigh TUFFWEIGH. With two weighing platforms, stainless steal platform or the double molded detachable cover, use either option that fits your needs. Truweigh also included two AAA batteries, making our jewelry scale ready to use as soon as you receive it. The Truweigh TUFFWEIGH digital weight scale crosses over as a versatile counter top scale. It can be used as a scale for packages, reloading equipment, soap making supplies, scale for food, travel scale, resin scale for DIY projects, meat scale, gold scale, and so much more. With impeccable accuracy trust in Truweigh to help make sure your next meal or at home DIY project is finished with precision and accurate weights. It converts automatically between: G / OZ / OZT / DWT / CT / GN.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51o-sTgnImL._SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Truweigh","source_asin":"B0BS73LVJ5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-228184","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BS73LVJ5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BS73LVJ5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
