window.products.push({"id":228342,"name":"THE ART BOX Wall Tapestry for Bedroom Aesthetic Tapestry Hippie Boho Tapestry Indie Tapestry Bohemian Mandala Tapestry Cool Spiritual Trippy Tapestry ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91R47OqnwFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE ART BOX Wall Tapestry - With its large 104\" x 90\" king size and captivating Indian mandala design, this serves as an inspiring centerpiece for any space. Boasting intricate patterns, this handmade tapestry exudes a boho aesthetic that's both captivating and calming. The mandala's symbolism promotes a sense of unity and wholeness, transforming any bedroom or living room into a sanctuary of peace and tranquility. 100% Natural Cotton - Eco-friendly and crafted from 100% natural cotton, this wall tapestry is gentle on the skin and environmentally conscious. Its high-quality material ensures durability, while its delicate hand-sewn edges showcase a meticulous attention to detail. With easy cleaning and fast drying, the tapestry remains a practical and attractive addition to your home Handmade by Artisans - Originating from India, the tapestry's authenticity is apparent in both its design and fabrication. The masterful hand sewing results in neat, finished edges that are easy to hang or pack away, whether for indoor or outdoor applications. This is often given as an exciting gift for anyone who enjoys beautiful wall hangings that add to the enjoyment of your home Use Many Ways - Versatility abounds with the ART BOX Wall Tapestry, as it can be utilized for various purposes, including wall decor, bohemian bedding, a hippie bedspread, beach or picnic blanket, tablecloth, yoga mat, room divider, ceiling decor, and window curtains. Its multifaceted functionality allows the tapestry to seamlessly integrate into any home decor theme or style Instantly Transforms Your Space - The rich heritage and striking design of this Indian mandala tapestry offers a fascinating symbol of unity and wholeness, the mandala is an ideal focal point for those seeking balance, serenity, and a touch of boho chic. Embrace the beauty and versatility of the ART BOX Wall Tapestry, and let its captivating patterns uplift your surroundings","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91R47OqnwFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"THE ART BOX","source_asin":"B0C1NYQXDD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-228342","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1NYQXDD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1NYQXDD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
