window.products.push({"id":228356,"name":"U-Taste 536ºF Heat Resistant 8.2 Inches Silicone Trivet Mats for Hot Pots and Pans, Non-Slip Round Rubber Hot Pads for Dishes Cups Plates Kitchen Tabl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WwF-GjMBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Not just make it, we upgrade it.] We are a professional kitchenware producer who have been focus on customer experience. In order to offer better and eco-friendly kitchenware, U-Taste collects customer reviews of all similar products on Amazon. And then upgrade the products based on the data of the bad evaluation with the aim to provide customers with more perfect kitchenware products. [-22℉~ 536℉ Heat Resistant] With high heat resistant up to 536℉, this silicone trivet mat can protect your countertop from the heat of a hot pots and pans and protect the wood/glass table and vinyl tablecloth from getting damaged. These rubber trivets also can be used as pot holders to grab pans from the oven or microwave without the heat going through and burning your hand. U-Taste hot stuff trivet is safe for food contact because of its food grade BPA free silicone. [Non-slip for Grabbing] Firstly, the non-slip surface keeps it from falling on the floor. Secondly, you can use it as a gripper to open a lid on a jar. Thirdly, pick up hot containers after you heat them up. Fourthly, grab hot bowls of soup from the microwave or pull pots out of the oven. Finally, they are thick enough to use as potholders and keep your fingers from burning, especially for the cast iron pot. A must have multipurpose kitchen gadget for your kitchen. [Versatile Addition to Your Kitchen] In addition to the functions mentioned above, you can also set dishes, wine glasses, forks, cups on to drip dry; protect your desk and vanity from hot curling irons; cool a pot and put serving dishes on; place food on it directly for cooling; keep different items in your motor home basement from slipping while traveling; and use it under your cat dishes as they hoover their meals. A great housewarming and Christmas gift for your family and friends. [Easy to Clean and Store] With translucent frosted and reasonable space between the lines, U-Taste silicon trivets for hot pots and pans are not easy to get dirty and trap dirt or food mess in it. Easy to clean by running under hot water or just pop them in the dishwasher. And they take up little space in your drawer. Space light series pattern makes your kitchen look vibrant. 0.28in Hanging Hole for easy hang up on your wall for display and easy access.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WwF-GjMBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"U-Taste","source_asin":"B09DQ7STH7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-228356","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DQ7STH7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DQ7STH7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
