window.products.push({"id":228493,"name":"Pizza Peel with Detachable Beech Handle, 14 x 16 inch Blade, 51 inch Long, Light and Sturdy Aluminum Pizza Paddle for Baking Homemade Pizza Bread","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51KSci+9tsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"There are few things better than hot, fresh pizza from your favorite pizzeria, unless it’s a delicious homemade pizza that you customize with your favorite toppings. If you want an authentic pizzeria-quality pie at home, you have to have the right equipment, and a pizza peel is definitely a must-have tool. USING A PIZZA PEEL Sprinkle the surface of the pizza peel with some coarse cornmeal or flour to make sure the dough doesn’t stick to it. Carefully transfer your rolled pizza dough to the peel. Add the sauce, cheese, and other toppings, and take the peel to the pizza stone. Carefully slide the pizza onto the stone. Cook the pizza according to the recipe’s instructions. Use the pizza peel to remove the hot pizza from the cooking surface when it’s ready. Care Instructions Hand wash only. Scrap off any excess food or crumbs from the peel using a soft sponge. Dry immediately. Hand wash only. Scrap off any excess food or crumbs from the peel using a soft sponge. Dry immediately. Avoid abrasive cleaning materials. Not dishwasher safe. Avoid abrasive cleaning materials. Not dishwasher safe. Once you are finished cleaning, store indoors, detach the handle for easy storage. Once you are finished cleaning, store indoors, detach the handle for easy storage. Do not slice pizza or baked goods on the peel. It may damage knife or scratch peel. Do not slice pizza or baked goods on the peel. It may damage knife or scratch peel. Do not leave the peel exposed to high temperatures for extended periods of time. Do not leave the peel exposed to high temperatures for extended periods of time. Materials: Peel Head: Commercial-Grade Aluminum. Handle: All-Natural Beech. Measurement: Blade size: 14\"x16\" (Rectangular) Dimension of the smallest handle: 18.5 inch, Dimension of the longest handle – fully extended: 35 inch Total pizza peel length- fully assembled: 14\"x51\" Ergonomic handle diameter: 1.18\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51KSci+9tsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Komista","source_asin":"B08MDVHWWG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-228493","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08MDVHWWG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08MDVHWWG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
