window.products.push({"id":228780,"name":"Bush Furniture Woodland Full Entryway Storage Set with Coat Rack and Shoe Bench with Doors, Traditional, Ash Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":1098.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AsnJzbfKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The kathy ireland Home by Bush Furniture Woodland Full Entryway Storage Set with Coat Rack and Shoe Bench with Doors combines transitional styling and a practical design to offer an ideal organization solution. Have a seat on the durable storage bench and take a moment to relax as you get ready to head out the door or come home after a long day. Each section of the long mudroom bench supports up to 250 pounds, so you can sit down to put on and take off your shoes or set shopping bags down after a trip to the store with confidence. Two small storage cabinets and cube shelving to the left and right accommodate footwear and accessories for a clutter-free entryway, mudroom or foyer. The narrow hall trees and wall mounted shelf include a total of 10 Weathered Nickel coat hooks in the front and one on each side for hanging jackets, hats, scarves and more. Smaller items like gloves and keys can be stashed neatly inside seven open compartments, and the top shelves provide an area to brighten up your entryway with decorations. The hall tree bench's transitional design blends elements of contemporary and traditional styling to complement a wide range of home furnishings while your choice of Cape Cod Gray, White Ash and Ash Brown finish options make it easy to find the perfect look for your space. This entryway bench and coat rack set has been tested to meet Bush Furniture's standards for safety, performance and durability and is backed by a 3 Year Manufacturer's Warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AsnJzbfKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bush Furniture","source_asin":"B0BWYQF4WM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-228780","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWYQF4WM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWYQF4WM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
