window.products.push({"id":228942,"name":"avonleigh LINENS 1000 Thread Count 100% Cotton Sheet White King Sheet Set, 4 Piece Long Staple Combed Cotton Sheet, Breathable, Soft & Silky Sateen We","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ezg2DlrXS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cotton Luxury & Durability: Our 100% Cotton Sheet Set have been crafted With Cool and Crisp Percale using the long staple cotton fibre, which adds to the supremely softer hand feel along With luxurious look and enhances the durability of the sheets. These sheets are manufactured With no harmful chemicals in such a way that it retains softness after wash and are fade resistant. To maintain the softness, we would recommend to regular laundering. Also, Available in Twin , Full King and Cal, King AVONLEIGH PACKAGE CONTENT: Avonleigh Linens brings to you the PUREST 100% Certified Long Staple Cotton Cotton Sheet Set. This Full Size White color set includes: 1 Flat Sheet (81\"x96\"), 1 Fitted Sheet (54\" x 75\" + 15\") With extra deep pockets to fit mattresses from 9\" to 15\", 2 Pillowcases (20\"x30\"). This product is shipped to you in an environmental friendly gift pack. STANDARD 100 by OEKO-TEX: Our product is manufactured WithOUT harmful chemicals. Prior to stitching, fabric tested for meeting performance like no pilling, shrinkage, colour fastness, tear strength and thread count authenticity. Then it is inspected, piece by piece, to ensure that each packed is defect free. To maintain the softness, we would recommend to regular laundering. LEED v4 GOLD CERTIFIED: Made Ethically in India in a certified, socially compliant and awarded factory that manufactures fabric in one of its kind Gold Rated LEED v4 Certified Facility equipped With most modern machinery. The factory is the second manufacturing facility in the World to achieve Gold LEED EBOM certification from the United States Green Building Council (USGBC) YOUR TRUST AND OUR ASSURANCE: TOTAL SATISFACTION GUARANTEE: Night's sleep is something that set's off for a good day’s, and We believe in \"live well, sleep well\". To ensure, we test our product and inspect each piece, it to be defect free, which makes these sheets an ideal gift for any occasion for men and women, Mother’s Day, Father’s Day, Valentine’s Day and Christmas. These sheets design can match any home décor and would be perfect for any room in your home. So why to wait? Order Now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ezg2DlrXS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AVONLEIGH LINENS","source_asin":"B08CVLBZWS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-228942","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CVLBZWS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CVLBZWS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
